# E2 (PLAN_ENTERPRISE_REGRESSION.md): the Accessibility demo's own top-level nav destination —
# every existing test against this page (`tests/mixed/storefront.tflw`) reaches it via a hardcoded
# `open "/a11y-demo"`; this is the one test in the suite that reaches it by actually clicking the
# global nav link, proving the nav's own wiring rather than assuming the route.

@ui
test "navigating to the Accessibility demo via the top nav renders its accessible controls"
  open "/"
  click text "Accessibility demo"
  expect field "Subscribe to updates" not is checked
  check field "Subscribe to updates"
  expect field "Subscribe to updates" is checked
